licate refunds\",\n      \"confidence\": \"high\",\n      \"evidence\": [\n        \"api_gateway_2026-05-01.log: request_class=bulk-refund idempotency_key=missing status=accepted\",\n        \"incident_timeline.md: bulk refund requests accepted without idempotency keys at 10:17 UTC\",\n        \"TICKET-8721.md: duplicate refunds observed for three enterprise accounts\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"finding\": \"bulk-refund endpoint disabled as emergency mitigation at 10:38 UTC\",\n      \"confidence\": \"high\",\n      \"evidence\": [\n        \"incident_timeline.md: bulk-refund endpoint disabled at 10:38 UTC\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"unresolved_ambiguity\": \"Initial theory in TICKET-8721 suggested queue worker replayed old payment event, but API gateway logs show guardrail bypass was root cause; worker replay theory was opened before logs were available\"\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
